{"id":"6d51f43eabef852a","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-smooth-lie-action-data.md","title":"Smooth Lie Group and Transitive Action Data","display":"df-smooth-lie-action-data — Smooth Lie Group and Transitive Action Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-smooth-lie-action-data","aliases":["58-df-smooth-lie-action-data"],"display":"df-smooth-lie-action-data — Smooth Lie Group and Transitive Action Data","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-smooth-lie-action-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-smooth-lie-action-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smooth-lie-action-data — Smooth Lie Group and Transitive Action Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,G,X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\rho,\\mu,\\iota,e,f\\in V\">\\(M,N,G,X,\\tau,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\rho,\\mu,\\iota,e,f\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^0=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\mathbb R^0=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^\\frown v\">\\(u^\\frown v\\)</span> 表示有限实向量连接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau|_U=\\{W\\cap U:W\\in\\tau\\}\">\\(\\tau|_U=\\{W\\cap U:W\\in\\tau\\}\\)</span>。对两组拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\otimes\\sigma=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal W:\\mathcal W\\subseteq\\{U\\times V:U\\in\\tau,V\\in\\sigma\\}\\}\">\\(\\tau\\otimes\\sigma=\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal W:\\mathcal W\\subseteq\\{U\\times V:U\\in\\tau,V\\in\\sigma\\}\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 维坐标卡 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\">\\(c=\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 维坐标卡 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d=\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\">\\(d=\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\boxtimes d=\\langle U\\times V,\\{u^\\frown v:u\\in W,v\\in Z\\},\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\phi(x)^\\frown\\psi(y)\\rangle:x\\in U,y\\in V\\}\\rangle\">\\(c\\boxtimes d=\\langle U\\times V,\\{u^\\frown v:u\\in W,v\\in Z\\},\\{\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle,\\phi(x)^\\frown\\psi(y)\\rangle:x\\in U,y\\in V\\}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\boxtimes\\mathcal B=\\{c\\boxtimes d:c\\in\\mathcal A,d\\in\\mathcal B\\}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\boxtimes\\mathcal B=\\{c\\boxtimes d:c\\in\\mathcal A,d\\in\\mathcal B\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的辅助接口仅补充零维情形；已定义的正维光滑结构和光滑映射接口不改名、不改域。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(g,h)\">\\(\\mu(g,h)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(\\langle g,h\\rangle)\">\\(\\mu(\\langle g,h\\rangle)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LieGroup}\">\\(\\mathrm{LieGroup}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LieGroupData}\">\\(\\mathrm{LieGroupData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenEuclidean}\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenEuclidean}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothEuclidean}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothEuclidean}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenEuclidean}^{0}_{58}(W,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in W\\;\\exists r&gt;0\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|y-x\\|_2&lt;r\\to y\\in W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OpenEuclidean}^{0}_{58}(W,n)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\n\\forall x\\in W\\;\\exists r&gt;0\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(\\|y-x\\|_2&lt;r\\to y\\in W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothEuclidean}^{0}_{58}(f,W,m,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OpenEuclidean}^{0}_{58}(W,m)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land f\\in(\\mathbb R^n)^W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(m=0\\lor n=0\\lor\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(f,W,m,n)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothEuclidean}^{0}_{58}(f,W,m,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{OpenEuclidean}^{0}_{58}(W,m)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land f\\in(\\mathbb R^n)^W\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(m=0\\lor n=0\\lor\\mathrm{EuclideanSmoothMap}_S(f,W,m,n)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(n&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\Bigl(n=0\\land\\tau=\\mathcal P(M)\\land|M|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathcal A=\\{\\langle\\{x\\},\\{\\varnothing\\},\\{\\langle x,\\varnothing\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in M\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(n&gt;0\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\Bigl(n=0\\land\\tau=\\mathcal P(M)\\land|M|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\mathcal A=\\{\\langle\\{x\\},\\{\\varnothing\\},\\{\\langle x,\\varnothing\\rangle\\}\\rangle:x\\in M\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}^{0}_{58}(f,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal B,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal B,n)\\land f\\in N^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\exists\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_M\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in O\\subseteq U\\land f[O]\\subseteq V\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SmoothEuclidean}^{0}_{58}\n(\\{\\langle\\phi(y),\\psi(f(y))\\rangle:y\\in O\\},\\phi[O],m,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}^{0}_{58}(f,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal B,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal B,n)\\land f\\in N^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\exists\\langle U,W,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\exists\\langle V,Z,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_M\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in O\\subseteq U\\land f[O]\\subseteq V\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{SmoothEuclidean}^{0}_{58}\n(\\{\\langle\\phi(y),\\psi(f(y))\\rangle:y\\in O\\},\\phi[O],m,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LieGroupData}_{58}(G,\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m)\n\\land\\mu\\in G^{G\\times G}\\land\\iota\\in G^G\\land e\\in G\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;\\mu(\\mu(a,b),c)=\\mu(a,\\mu(b,c)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall a\\in G\\;\\mu(e,a)=a=\\mu(a,e)\n\\land\\mu(\\iota(a),a)=e=\\mu(a,\\iota(a)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}^{0}_{58}(\\mu,G\\times G,\\tau_G\\otimes\\tau_G,\n\\mathcal A_G\\boxtimes\\mathcal A_G,2m,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}^{0}_{58}(\\iota,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LieGroupData}_{58}(G,\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m)\n\\land\\mu\\in G^{G\\times G}\\land\\iota\\in G^G\\land e\\in G\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;\\mu(\\mu(a,b),c)=\\mu(a,\\mu(b,c)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall a\\in G\\;\\mu(e,a)=a=\\mu(a,e)\n\\land\\mu(\\iota(a),a)=e=\\mu(a,\\iota(a)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}^{0}_{58}(\\mu,G\\times G,\\tau_G\\otimes\\tau_G,\n\\mathcal A_G\\boxtimes\\mathcal A_G,2m,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}^{0}_{58}(\\iota,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LieGroup}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G\\in V\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{LieGroupData}_{58}(G,\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LieGroup}_S(G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G\\in V\\;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{LieGroupData}_{58}(G,\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}_S(\\rho,G,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,\\mathcal A_X\\in V\\;\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{LieGroupData}_{58}(G,\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_X,n)\n\\land\\rho\\in(X^X)^G\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\rho(e)(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\rho(\\mu(g,h))(x)=\\rho(g)(\\rho(h)(x)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists g\\in G\\;\\rho(g)(x)=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}^{0}_{58}\n(\\{\\langle\\langle g,x\\rangle,\\rho(g)(x)\\rangle:g\\in G,x\\in X\\},\nG\\times X,\\tau_G\\otimes\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_G\\boxtimes\\mathcal A_X,m+n,\nX,\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_X,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothTransitiveAction}_S(\\rho,G,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,\\mathcal A_X\\in V\\;\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{LieGroupData}_{58}(G,\\mu,\\iota,e,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,m)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SmoothStructure}^{0}_{58}(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_X,n)\n\\land\\rho\\in(X^X)^G\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\rho(e)(x)=x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\rho(\\mu(g,h))(x)=\\rho(g)(\\rho(h)(x)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists g\\in G\\;\\rho(g)(x)=y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{SmoothMapData}^{0}_{58}\n(\\{\\langle\\langle g,x\\rangle,\\rho(g)(x)\\rangle:g\\in G,x\\in X\\},\nG\\times X,\\tau_G\\otimes\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_G\\boxtimes\\mathcal A_X,m+n,\nX,\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_X,n)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有作用恒等式、逆元、乘法、光滑性均使用同一组群与流形结构见证。零维 Lie 群没有因正维旧接口而被意外排除；没有额外强加紧性、连通性、忠实性或单连通性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":